# Wave T36 (Starfall kit): dockfloor — Starfall City's second
# registered street kind (the pier material, slateport/olivine
# two-material terms). HARBOUR DOCK FLOOR: HORIZONTAL weathered
# harbour boards, pale grey-brown faces with dark tar seams,
# staggered end joints and sparse whitewash flecks. Long
# horizontal boards differ from Beacon's vertical tarred-batten
# jettyfloor, Tidehaven's vertical pier timber, Highbranch's
# rope-lashed vertical planks and the shipped horizontal
# boardwalk (plain seams, no tar, no whitewash — and not used
# here). Lands the r124/r125/r126 surf seams and the E bridge.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T36-STARFALL-PLAN.md.)
